item.description:
[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Expense Agent now supports creating expenses from imported credit card transaction feeds or automatically reconcile with them if the expense was created earlier. Key capabilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Import credit card transaction data and review it in the web and mobile apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automatic (GA: December CY2026) — Dynamics 365 Business Central

&lt;p&gt;Currently, to bring tasks from another project into a new project, you must manually enter the task details in the task grid or use schedule APIs. You can also use the &lt;strong&gt;Copy project&lt;/strong&gt; feature to create a new project with the same tasks, but this feature has limitations:&lt;br&gt;
​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;u (GA: October CY2026) — Dynamics 365 Project Operations
